                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Er... What the...? This is a somewhat Time-management game with some RPG on it. The graphics are modest. The music is Ok. The story is... something?\n\nNo bugs or crashes, so far.\n\nOverall, a boring task. There are 3 creatures/obstacles and they come at you all at the same time, then you need to do 3 different things for each one to scare them away. Basically, it's running around doing 4 things. That's the game. Did I say game? If by \"game\" you understand a ludic activity, then this is NOT that.",
